      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Three Bedroom Semi Detached Residence\r\n\r\nPhoenix Estates are delighted to present to the market this tastefully finished three-bedroom semi-detached residence with private driveway and large rear garden. The property which is set in small cul-de-sac is located in the popular village of Adamstown. Viewing is strongly recommended on this tastefully finished property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: L-shape 5.951 x 1.170, 2.6 x 1.15 tiled floor, staircase to first floor, under stairs storage, coving.\r\nLiving room: 5.05 x 4.75 tiled floors, open fire marble fireplace, bay windows, coving.  \r\nKitchen/dining: 5.4 x 2.7 fitted kitchen eye and waist level units, marble counter taps, breakfast counter, tiled floor, tiled splash back, patio door to the rear.\r\nW.C: 1.35 x 1.35 tiled floor, partially tiled walls, coving, W.C, WHB.\r\nMaster Bedroom: 5.15 x 3.77 max. laminated wooden floors, fitted wardrobes, 2 windows.\r\nEnsuite: 1.73 x 1.71 fully tiled floors and walls, W.C, WHB, Free standing shower Triton T90SR.\r\nBedroom 2: 3.35 x 3.30 laminated wooden floors, fitted units.\r\nBedroom 3: 3.30 x 1.90 laminated wooden floors. \r\nBathroom: 2.05 x1.8 fully tiled floors and walls, bath, W.C, WHB."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tHigh standard of finish, showhouse condition\r\n•\tSpacious kitchen\r\n•\tDouble-glazed uPVC windows\r\n•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\tPrivate driveway\r\n•\tSide entrance\r\n•\tLarge rear garden\r\n•\tExcellent position both in the estate and in the village of Adamstown"
      },
